{title: 269 - Come, Holy Spirit}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Holy Spirit}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[G]Come, Holy [Am/C]Spirit, heavenly [D7/A]Dove, [G]With [D/F#]all [G]Thy [Em]quickening [Am]powers;
[Am]Kindle aflame [D]of sacred [Bm]love In [C]these cold [G/D]hearts [D7]of [G]ours.

Verse 2:
[G]O raise [Bm]our [D]thoughts [D7/A]from [D/F#]things [Em]below,
[G]From vanities and [Am]toys!
[Am]Then shall [D]we with [Bm]fresh [C]courage [D7]go
[Am]To reach [D]eternal [D7]joys.

Verse 3:
[G]Awake [Bm]our [D]souls [D7/A]to [D/F#]joyful [Am]songs;
[G]Let pure [Am]devotions rise;
[Am]Till praise [D]employs our [C]thankful [G/D]tongues,
[Am]And doubt [D]forever [D7]dies.

Verse 4:
[G]Father, [Bm]we [D]would [D7/A]no [D/F#]longer [Am]live
[G]At [Am/C]this [D]poor, dying rate;
[Am]To Thee [D]our thankful [C]love [G/D]we [D7]give,
[Am]For Thine [D]to [Bm]us [C/E]is [D7]great.

Verse 5:
[G]Come, Holy [Am]Spirit, [G]heavenly [Am]Dove,
[G]With all [Bm]Thy [D]quickening [Em]powers;
[Am]Come, shed [D]abroad [Bm]a [C]Savior's [D7]love,
[Am]And that [D]shall [Bm]kindle [D7]ours.
